<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1593" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">agnīnus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>pertaining to a lamb</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμνείος</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lactes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ps. 1, 3, 85</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 3, 95</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coagulum,</span>”
				<i>rennet</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 11, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pedes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					30, 8, 21, § 68</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jus,</span>”
				<i>lamb-broth</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 189</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">agnīna</span></b> , ae, f. (sc.
			caro), <i>the flesh of a lamb as eaten</i>, <i>lamb</i> (like porcina, <i>pork</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Plaut. Capt. 4, 2, 69</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ferina,</span>”
				<i>venison</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 1, 215</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitulina,</span>”
				<i>veal</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Nep. Ages. 8, 4</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">Plaut. Aul. 2, 8, 4</span></i>: et duplā
				(<i>at double price</i>) agninam danunt, <i><span class="en">id. Capt.
				4, 2, 39</span></i> Lind.: patinas cenabat omasi Vilis et agninae,
			* <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 15, 35</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
